                <h1 id="payments">Payments</h1>

    <p>APIs for managing payment transactions.
Payments are associated with orders and can be made via various methods
(credit card, bank transfer, e-wallet, etc.).</p>

                                <h2 id="payments-GETapi-payments">Get all payments</h2>

<p>
<small class="badge badge-darkred">requires authentication</small>
</p>

